            <description><![CDATA[Weekly summary of new Baseline items in BCD data]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<main>
    <p>
	Summary of BCD changes from <a href=""><time title="Monday, 31 August 2026">Monday, 31 August 2026</time></a> through <time title="Monday, 7 September 2026">Monday, 7 September 2026</time></strong><a href="https://bcd-watch.igalia.com/weekly-completed/2026-09-07.html" title="permalink">🔗</a>
    </p>
    <hr>


          <p class="callout"><strong>3 new universal implementations</strong></p>
          <section class="added implementations">
	            <h4>JAVASCRIPT</h4>
              <ol>
                  <li>

          

                      <span>
                        <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Iterator/join">javascript ➞ builtins ➞ Iterator ➞ join</a>
                      </span>
                    
                    <b><br></b> 
                    <span class="browsers">Added to <strong>Chrome</strong></span> 
                    <b>&nbsp;➞&nbsp;</b>
                    <span class="ni3 engines"><strong>3 of 3</strong> engines</span>

                  </li>
                  <li>

          

                      <span>
                        <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Iterator/zip">javascript ➞ builtins ➞ Iterator ➞ zip</a>
                      </span>
                    
                    <b><br></b> 
                    <span class="browsers">Added to <strong>Chrome</strong></span> 
                    <b>&nbsp;➞&nbsp;</b>
                    <span class="ni3 engines"><strong>3 of 3</strong> engines</span>

                  </li>
                  <li>

          

                      <span>
                        <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Iterator/zipKeyed">javascript ➞ builtins ➞ Iterator ➞ zipKeyed</a>
                      </span>
                    
                    <b><br></b> 
                    <span class="browsers">Added to <strong>Chrome</strong></span> 
                    <b>&nbsp;➞&nbsp;</b>
                    <span class="ni3 engines"><strong>3 of 3</strong> engines</span>

                  </li>
              </ol>
          </section>

